<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-S.AFRICA 64-4 AT LUNCH VS AUSTRALIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-S.AFRICA 64-4 AT LUNCH VS AUSTRALIA.</headline>
<dateline>PORT ELIZABETH 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa were 64 for four wickets at lunch on the first day of the second test against Australia in Port Elizabeth on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: South Africa 64-4.</p>
</text>
